ME ASURES SUBMIT TED TO THE VO TERS ST ATE OF CALIFORNIA Pr oposition 1AUTHORIZES BONDS FOR HOUSING AFFORD ABILIT YPR OGRAMS. LEGISL ATIVE ST ATUTE. Authorizes $11.25 billion in state general obligation bonds for housing affordability programs, including multifamily rental housing, mortgages for veterans, supportive housing, preservation of existing affordable housing, and downpayment assistance. Fiscal Imp act: Increased state cost of $500 million to $600 million annually for about 25 years to repay the housing bond. 

