Pr oposition 37 CRE ATES LOAN PR OGRAM FOR MIDDLE -INC OME BUYERS OF QU ALIFIED NE W HOMES. INITIA TIVE ST ATUTE. Authorizes $25 billion in bonds to offer eligible buyers fixed -rate mortgages for up to 17% of purchase price of a newly constructed home priced below about $1.5 million. Borrowers must be California residents, occupy the home, meet income limits, and pay at least 3% down. Bonds repaid by mortgage payments, not State. 

