Pr oposition 42 PR OHIBITS NE W ST ATE PERSONAL PR OPER TY TAXES AND CER TAIN RE TR OACTIVE ST ATE TAXES. INITIA TIVE CONSTITUTIONAL AMENDMENT .

Prohibits any new state tax (1) imposed on the ownership of personal property (all things people own other than real estate), or (2) that applies retroactively based on taxpayer's past activities. Nullifies taxes enacted after January 1, 2026 that conflict with this measure. 

